  unitName: Siren
  unitId: 20093
  unitNumber: 114
  description: A beautiful, high-ranked water spirit that lives in oceans. She has
    strong magical power, excelling in water magic. When the power of Undine increases,
    it grows wings and can freely fly to all waters. Love is her magic's source,and
    she showers unlimited affection on their lovers. However, she bares her fangs
    towards their lover's enemies.
  summonDesc: Will you take me along?<br>I'm so happy.<br>I offer you my heart.
  fusionDesc: This is your love.<br>Power rises from it like a fountain...
  evoDesc: Your love changed me.<br>I will be your strength.
